{"language":"cn","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","回旋突刺"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","对前方快速造成多次伤害，随后突进至区域末端，并再次造成伤害。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","选择一个方向，对前方3格长、3格宽的范围内的敌人进行8次神速刺击，每次造成35% + 4% ATK伤害。随后快速突进至该区域末端，并再次对该区域内所有敌人造成180% + 20% ATK伤害。本技能的每次伤害都会附带目标当前生命值4%的额外伤害，最高不超过自身攻击力的160%。本技能释放期间，索尼娅免疫控制效果。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":40,"end":45,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":83,"end":89,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":37,"end":49,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":79,"end":93,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","每次神速刺击造成的伤害提高至40% + 4% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":22,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","每次神速刺击造成的伤害提高至45% + 4% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":22,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","每次神速刺击造成的伤害提高至50% + 4% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":22,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","最后一击的伤害提高至220% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":20,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","血薇誓约"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时与左右各一名友军签订誓约，使其不断提高属性值。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时，选择布阵在自己左侧和右侧相邻位置的各一名友军，与之建立“血薇誓约”（优先选择其中布阵更靠前的友军），并使这两名友军立即提升10% + 1%攻击力、15% + 1.5%护甲与魔抗。本技能释放期间，索尼娅免疫控制效果。“血薇誓约”存续时，这两名友军每6秒还会额外提升3% + 0.3%攻击力、4% + 0.4%护甲与魔抗，最多叠加6层。\n当任意一名“血薇誓约”成员被击败时，“血薇誓约”将立即终结，同时索尼娅将会收回并获得所有“血薇誓约”成员身上已经累积的这部分属性加成，持续至战斗结束。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":70,"end":75,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":82,"end":89,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg4"},{"start":139,"end":146,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"},{"start":152,"end":159,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg5"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","建立誓约时，友军获得的攻击力比例提高至13% + 1%、护甲与魔抗比例提高至18% + 1.5%。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":22,"end":27,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":41,"end":48,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg4"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","后续每隔6秒，友军额外获得的攻击力比例提高至4% + 0.3%、护甲与魔抗比例提高至5% + 0.4%。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":24,"end":31,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"},{"start":44,"end":51,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg5"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","建立誓约时，友军获得的攻击力比例提高至16% + 1%、护甲与魔抗比例提高至21% + 1.5%。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":22,"end":27,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":41,"end":48,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg4"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","待客之道"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","对周围的敌人造成两次伤害和眩晕。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","挥舞披风，对周围1格范围内的敌人造成两次120% + 10% ATK伤害，并且每次附带1 + 0.1秒眩晕。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":24,"end":30,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":44,"end":50,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":20,"end":34,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","本技能每次造成的伤害量提高至130% + 10% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":18,"end":24,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":28,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","本技能每次造成的伤害量提高至140% + 10% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":18,"end":24,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":28,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","每次附带的眩晕时间延长至1.5 + 0.1秒。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":21,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","提高自身急速。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的急速提升7.2点，且当自己首次释放终极技能之后，自身的急速额外提升7.2点。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的急速提升9.6点，且当自己首次释放终极技能之后，自身的急速额外提升9.6点。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的急速提升12点，且当自己首次释放终极技能之后，自身的急速额外提升12点。"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","不破之盟"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","首次释放终极技能后，“血薇誓约”将永久强化。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","额外获得100点初始能量。索尼娅首次释放终极技能后，将会使友方的“血薇誓约”永久强化：“血薇誓约”不再会终结，且索尼娅在其他“血薇誓约”成员存活期间也能实时共享其身上累积的这部分属性加成。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","初始能量提高至200点。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","“血薇誓约”获得永久强化之后，其中任意成员受到伤害时，若有其他“血薇誓约”成员存活，则原始伤害量将会降低40%，降低部分的50%将由其余“血薇誓约”成员分摊（不会导致分摊者被击败）。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","“血薇誓约”获得永久强化之后，成员之间相互分摊伤害的比例降低至40%。"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","终极技能造成伤害量的一定比例将会转化为对自身的治疗。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","终极技能“回旋突刺”造成伤害的20%将立即转化为对索尼娅的治疗。"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","血薇权杖"]]}